  "operation": "Copy complete original event buffering module and both pooled dispatchers, dispatcher base and player removal context. Preserve signature hash, last context per signature, inactive buffering, activation replay/clear, immediate active dispatch, handle mutation/exception behavior, entity component order and pool/disposal order. Adapt component/event inputs to unchanged native objects, C# record struct syntax, scene lifecycle inputs and diagnostics. Replace two private one-subscriber MessagePipe transports and R3 subscription storage with explicit synchronous owned channel leases; no shared stage or interaction rules are implemented.",
  "validation_entry": "Zjcs.Editor.Map14.OfficialMap14BufferedEventsAcceptance.Run",
  "validation": "Unity 2022.3.57f1c2 / D3D11 on the internal display: graphical import/compile and Play Mode passed. Original signature buffering/replay, active dispatch, native stage/player-removal events, dynamic native add/remove and pooled dispatcher reuse/teardown passed. Stable client views, original visibility factory/handlers, display consumption/data, four statues, radar/cost/input/container regressions passed; current runtime frames inspected. Root static project check is recorded in the owning map page.",
  "limitations": [
